<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="nl">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Prijsstijging</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
        .header { background: #dc2626; color: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; text-align: center; }
        .content { background: #f9fafb; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; }
        .product-box { background: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 20px 0; }
        .product-row { display: flex; align-items: center; }
        .product-image { width: 100px; height: 100px; object-fit: contain; border-radius: 8px; margin-right: 20px; }
        .product-info { flex: 1; }
        .product-name { font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #333; }
        .price-box { text-align: center; margin-top: 15px; padding-top: 15px; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; }
        .old-price { color: #6b7280; text-decoration: line-through; font-size: 18px; }
        .new-price { color: #dc2626; font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold; }
        .increase { color: #dc2626; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 5px; }
        .button { display: inline-block; background: #2563eb; color: white; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 20px; }
        .footer { text-align: center; color: #6b7280; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 20px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; }
        .unsubscribe { color: #6b7280; text-decoration: underline; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <h1 style="margin: 0;">Let op!</h1>
        <p style="margin: 5px 0 0 0;">De prijs is gestegen</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
        <p>Hoi,</p>
        <p>De prijs van het product dat je volgt is gestegen.</p>

        <div class="product-box">
            <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                <tr>
                    {% if imageUrl %}
                    <td width="120" valign="top">
                        <img src="{{ imageUrl }}" alt="{{ productName }}" style="width: 100px; height: 100px; object-fit: contain; border-radius: 8px;">
                    </td>
                    {% endif %}
                    <td valign="top">
                        <div class="product-name">{{ productName }}</div>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </table>
            <div class="price-box">
                <div class="old-price">&euro; {{ oldPrice }}</div>
                <div class="new-price">&euro; {{ newPrice }}</div>
                {% if priceChangePercent %}
                <div class="increase">{{ priceChangePercent|abs|number_format(1) }}% duurder</div>
                {% endif %}
            </div>
        </div>

        <p style="text-align: center;">
            <a href="{{ productUrl }}" class="button">Bekijk product</a>
        </p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
        <p>Je ontvangt deze e-mail omdat je een prijsalert hebt ingesteld via ShopQ.</p>
        <p><a href="{{ unsubscribeUrl }}" class="unsubscribe">Uitschrijven van deze alert</a></p>
        <p>ShopQ - Automatische prijsmonitoring</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
